# Entities Module Rules

You are assigned exclusively to the **Entities** module workspace.

## Scope & Isolation
- Your work is strictly confined to `src/modules/entities/`.
- **CRITICAL:** Do not read, write, or modify code inside `dashboard`, `reports`, or `config` modules.
- If you need global CRM components, use the shared wrappers from `@/core/ui-kit/` (e.g., `CrmDataTable`, `CrmTreeTable`).

## Development & Testing
- Implement and test features inside `src/modules/entities/views/Sandbox.vue`.
- Access this isolated testing playground locally via the `/dev/entities` route.
- If registry collections are missing or incomplete, mock the data inside `src/mocks/handlers/entities.ts`.
- Use GraphQL bridges (`@/core/graphql/itemsBridge`, etc.) for record I/O — Directus HTTP cutover is complete.